{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a new custom Shopify section named “Loyalty Rewards Steps” and match the attached reference design as closely as possible.
    
    SECTION DESIGN
    - Full-width section with a very dark black-purple gradient background:
      radial-gradient(circle at center, #1B1115 0%, #0D0B13 70%, #090810 100%)
    - Add a thin vertical orange-red accent line along the far-left edge.
    - Use a centered content container with a maximum width of 1400px.
    - Desktop section height should be approximately 530px.
    - Use generous top and bottom spacing while preserving the compact appearance shown in the reference.
    
    HEADER CONTENT
    - Small uppercase eyebrow: “LOYALTY PROGRAM”
    - Use a condensed font, gold color #D5A536, wide letter spacing and approximately 11px font size.
    - Main heading on two lines:
      “GET REWARDED FOR”
      “LIVING OFF DUTY”
    - First line should be white.
    - Second line should use a left-to-right gradient from hot pink #FF246D through coral #FF543D to orange #FFA12D.
    - Heading should use a tall, narrow, condensed uppercase font similar to Bebas Neue or Oswald Condensed.
    - Desktop heading size: approximately 40–44px.
    - Supporting text:
      “Earn points when you shop, refer friends and support the Flip Flop Firefighter community.”
    - Keep the supporting text centered, muted light grey and restricted to approximately 420px width.
    
    STEPS LAYOUT
    Create three equal cards in one horizontal row:
    
    1. Number: 01
       Icon: simple outlined user icon
       Title: CREATE AN ACCOUNT
       Description: Sign up free and join the community instantly.
       Accent color: coral orange #F05B37
    
    2. Number: 02
       Icon: simple outlined lightning bolt
       Title: EARN POINTS
       Description: Every purchase, review and referral earns you points.
       Accent color: hot pink #F50068
    
    3. Number: 03
       Icon: simple outlined gift box
       Title: REDEEM REWARDS
       Description: Use points for discounts, exclusive gear and more.
       Accent color: gold #DEA937
    
    CARD DESIGN
    - Cards should be approximately 31–32% width and equal height.
    - Background: #111016 or an almost-black purple.
    - Border: 1px solid rgba(255, 95, 45, 0.20).
    - Border radius: 12px.
    - Approximately 145–150px tall on desktop.
    - Each circular step-number badge must overlap the top border and be horizontally centered.
    - Badge size: approximately 32px.
    - Badge text should be small, condensed and white.
    - Match each badge background to its card accent color.
    - Add the outlined icon below the badge with adequate top spacing.
    - Icons should be around 20px and inherit the card accent color.
    - Titles should be white, uppercase, condensed and approximately 15–16px.
    - Descriptions should be muted grey #B8B5C0, approximately 12–13px, with a comfortable line height.
    - Keep all content centered.
    - Do not add card shadows or decorative graphics.
    
    BUTTONS
    Add two centered buttons below the cards:
    
    Primary button:
    - Label: “Join Rewards”
    - Shopify button link setting.
    - Gradient background from #FF276B to #FF5B38.
    - White text.
    - Approximately 140px wide and 42px high.
    - 9px border radius.
    
    Secondary button:
    - Label: “Member Login”
    - Shopify button link setting.
    - Transparent dark background.
    - Cyan border and text #00DCEB.
    - Approximately 134px wide and 42px high.
    - 9px border radius.
    
    Keep approximately 12px between the buttons. Add subtle hover states:
    - Primary button becomes slightly brighter and moves up 1px.
    - Secondary button fills with a low-opacity cyan background.
    
    SHOPIFY SECTION SETTINGS
    Provide editable settings for:
    - Eyebrow text
    - Both heading lines
    - Heading gradient colors
    - Description
    - Background colors
    - Left accent-line color
    - Three repeatable step blocks
    - Step number
    - Icon selector: user, lightning and gift
    - Step title
    - Step description
    - Step accent color
    - Primary button label and link
    - Secondary button label and link
    - Desktop and mobile section spacing
    - Option to show or hide the left accent line
    
    RESPONSIVE BEHAVIOUR
    - Desktop: three cards in one row.
    - Tablet: three cards may remain in one row with reduced gaps and typography.
    - Mobile: stack cards vertically with 16px gaps.
    - Mobile section height should be automatic.
    - Use approximately 20px horizontal padding.
    - Keep the heading centered and reduce it to 32–36px.
    - Stack the two buttons vertically at full width on small mobile screens.
    - Preserve the overlapping numbered badges.
    - Prevent all text, buttons and badges from clipping.
    
    TECHNICAL REQUIREMENTS
    - Build this as a standalone Shopify Online Store 2.0 Liquid section compatible with the Horizon theme.
    - Use semantic HTML, scoped CSS and lightweight vanilla JavaScript only if required.
    - Do not use external libraries, app dependencies or hardcoded URLs.
    - Use inline SVG icons so their stroke colors can follow the block accent colors.
    - Avoid overriding Horizon’s global styles.
    - Ensure the schema is valid and the section is fully editable in the Theme Editor.
    - Make all button and text colors accessible.
    - Match the spacing, proportions, borders, typography hierarchy and alignment of the 
{% enddoc %}
{% liquid
  assign section_id = section.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase
%}

{% style %}
  .loyalty-rewards-{{ section_id }} {
    position: relative;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at center, {{ section.settings.bg_color_center }} 0%, {{ section.settings.bg_color_mid }} 70%, {{ section.settings.bg_color_outer }} 100%);
    min-height: 530px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: {{ section.settings.spacing_top_desktop }}px 20px {{ section.settings.spacing_bottom_desktop }}px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  {% if section.settings.show_accent_line %}
    .loyalty-rewards-{{ section_id }}::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      top: 0;
      bottom: 0;
      width: 2px;
      background: {{ section.settings.accent_line_color }};
    }
  {% endif %}

  .loyalty-rewards-container-{{ section_id }} {
    max-width: 1400px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .loyalty-rewards-header-{{ section_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 56px;
  }

  .loyalty-rewards-eyebrow-{{ section_id }} {
    font-family: {{ section.settings.type_heading_font.family }}, {{ section.settings.type_heading_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: {{ section.settings.eyebrow_color }};
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .loyalty-rewards-heading-{{ section_id }} {
    font-family: {{ section.settings.type_heading_font.family }}, {{ section.settings.type_heading_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 44px;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
  }

  .loyalty-rewards-heading-line1-{{ section_id }} {
    display: block;
    color: {{ section.settings.heading_line1_color }};
  }

  .loyalty-rewards-heading-line2-{{ section_id }} {
    display: block;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, {{ section.settings.gradient_color_1 }} 0%, {{ section.settings.gradient_color_2 }} 50%, {{ section.settings.gradient_color_3 }} 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }

  .loyalty-rewards-description-{{ section_id }} {
    font-family: {{ section.settings.type_body_font.family }}, {{ section.settings.type_body_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: {{ section.settings.description_color }};
    max-width: 420px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .loyalty-rewards-steps-{{ section_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .loyalty-rewards-card-{{ section_id }} {
    flex: 1;
    background: {{ section.settings.card_bg_color }};
    border: 1px solid {{ section.settings.card_border_color }};
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 48px 24px 24px;
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
    min-height: 150px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .loyalty-rewards-badge-{{ section_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: -16px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-family: {{ section.settings.type_heading_font.family }}, {{ section.settings.type_heading_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .loyalty-rewards-icon-{{ section_id }} {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .loyalty-rewards-card-title-{{ section_id }} {
    font-family: {{ section.settings.type_heading_font.family }}, {{ section.settings.type_heading_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 16px;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }

  .loyalty-rewards-card-description-{{ section_id }} {
    font-family: {{ section.settings.type_body_font.family }}, {{ section.settings.type_body_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: {{ section.settings.card_text_color }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  .loyalty-rewards-buttons-{{ section_id }} {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .loyalty-rewards-btn-primary-{{ section_id }} {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0 28px;
    height: 42px;
    line-height: 42px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, {{ section.settings.primary_btn_gradient_1 }} 0%, {{ section.settings.primary_btn_gradient_2 }} 100%);
    color: {{ section.settings.primary_btn_text_color }};
    border-radius: 9px;
    font-family: {{ section.settings.type_body_font.family }}, {{ section.settings.type_body_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 14px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, filter 0.2s ease;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .loyalty-rewards-btn-primary-{{ section_id }}:hover {
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    filter: brightness(1.1);
  }

  .loyalty-rewards-btn-secondary-{{ section_id }} {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0 26px;
    height: 42px;
    line-height: 40px;
    background: {{ section.settings.secondary_btn_bg_color }};
    color: {{ section.settings.secondary_btn_text_color }};
    border: 1px solid {{ section.settings.secondary_btn_border_color }};
    border-radius: 9px;
    font-family: {{ section.settings.type_body_font.family }}, {{ section.settings.type_body_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 14px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background-color 0.2s ease;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .loyalty-rewards-btn-secondary-{{ section_id }}:hover {
    background-color: {{ section.settings.secondary_btn_hover_bg }};
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .loyalty-rewards-{{ section_id }} {
      min-height: auto;
      padding: {{ section.settings.spacing_top_mobile }}px 20px {{ section.settings.spacing_bottom_mobile }}px;
    }

    .loyalty-rewards-heading-{{ section_id }} {
      font-size: 36px;
    }

    .loyalty-rewards-steps-{{ section_id }} {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .loyalty-rewards-card-{{ section_id }} {
      padding: 52px 20px 28px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .loyalty-rewards-heading-{{ section_id }} {
      font-size: 32px;
    }

    .loyalty-rewards-buttons-{{ section_id }} {
      flex-direction: column;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .loyalty-rewards-btn-primary-{{ section_id }},
    .loyalty-rewards-btn-secondary-{{ section_id }} {
      width: 100%;
      text-align: center;
    }
  }

  {{ section.settings.type_body_font | font_face: font_display: 'swap' }}
  {{ section.settings.type_heading_font | font_face: font_display: 'swap' }}
{% endstyle %}

<div class="loyalty-rewards-{{ section_id }}">
  <div class="loyalty-rewards-container-{{ section_id }}">
    <div class="loyalty-rewards-header-{{ section_id }}">
      {% if section.settings.eyebrow_text != blank %}
        <div class="loyalty-rewards-eyebrow-{{ section_id }}">
          {{ section.settings.eyebrow_text }}
        </div>
      {% endif %}
      
      <h2 class="loyalty-rewards-heading-{{ section_id }}">
        <span class="loyalty-rewards-heading-line1-{{ section_id }}">{{ section.settings.heading_line1 }}</span>
        <span class="loyalty-rewards-heading-line2-{{ section_id }}">{{ section.settings.heading_line2 }}</span>
      </h2>

      {% if section.settings.description != blank %}
        <p class="loyalty-rewards-description-{{ section_id }}">
          {{ section.settings.description }}
        </p>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    <div class="loyalty-rewards-steps-{{ section_id }}">
      <div class="loyalty-rewards-card-{{ section_id }}">
        <div 
          class="loyalty-rewards-badge-{{ section_id }}"
          style="background-color: {{ section.settings.step1_accent_color }};"
        >
          {{ section.settings.step1_number }}
        </div>

        <div class="loyalty-rewards-icon-{{ section_id }}" style="color: {{ section.settings.step1_accent_color }};">
          {% case section.settings.step1_icon %}
            {% when 'user' %}
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path>
                <circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"></circle>
              </svg>
            {% when 'lightning' %}
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"></polygon>
              </svg>
            {% when 'gift' %}
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <polyline points="20 12 20 22 4 22 4 12"></polyline>
                <rect x="2" y="7" width="20" height="5"></rect>
                <line x1="12" y1="22" x2="12" y2="7"></line>
                <path d="M12 7H7.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0-5C11 2 12 7 12 7z"></path>
                <path d="M12 7h4.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 0-5C13 2 12 7 12 7z"></path>
              </svg>
          {% endcase %}
        </div>

        <h3 class="loyalty-rewards-card-title-{{ section_id }}">
          {{ section.settings.step1_title }}
        </h3>

        <p class="loyalty-rewards-card-description-{{ section_id }}">
          {{ section.settings.step1_description }}
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="loyalty-rewards-card-{{ section_id }}">
        <div 
          class="loyalty-rewards-badge-{{ section_id }}"
          style="background-color: {{ section.settings.step2_accent_color }};"
        >
          {{ section.settings.step2_number }}
        </div>

        <div class="loyalty-rewards-icon-{{ section_id }}" style="color: {{ section.settings.step2_accent_color }};">
          {% case section.settings.step2_icon %}
            {% when 'user' %}
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path>
                <circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"></circle>
              </svg>
            {% when 'lightning' %}
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"></polygon>
              </svg>
            {% when 'gift' %}
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <polyline points="20 12 20 22 4 22 4 12"></polyline>
                <rect x="2" y="7" width="20" height="5"></rect>
                <line x1="12" y1="22" x2="12" y2="7"></line>
                <path d="M12 7H7.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0-5C11 2 12 7 12 7z"></path>
                <path d="M12 7h4.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 0-5C13 2 12 7 12 7z"></path>
              </svg>
          {% endcase %}
        </div>

        <h3 class="loyalty-rewards-card-title-{{ section_id }}">
          {{ section.settings.step2_title }}
        </h3>

        <p class="loyalty-rewards-card-description-{{ section_id }}">
          {{ section.settings.step2_description }}
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="loyalty-rewards-card-{{ section_id }}">
        <div 
          class="loyalty-rewards-badge-{{ section_id }}"
          style="background-color: {{ section.settings.step3_accent_color }};"
        >
          {{ section.settings.step3_number }}
        </div>

        <div class="loyalty-rewards-icon-{{ section_id }}" style="color: {{ section.settings.step3_accent_color }};">
          {% case section.settings.step3_icon %}
            {% when 'user' %}
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path>
                <circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"></circle>
              </svg>
            {% when 'lightning' %}
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"></polygon>
              </svg>
            {% when 'gift' %}
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <polyline points="20 12 20 22 4 22 4 12"></polyline>
                <rect x="2" y="7" width="20" height="5"></rect>
                <line x1="12" y1="22" x2="12" y2="7"></line>
                <path d="M12 7H7.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0-5C11 2 12 7 12 7z"></path>
                <path d="M12 7h4.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 0-5C13 2 12 7 12 7z"></path>
              </svg>
          {% endcase %}
        </div>

        <h3 class="loyalty-rewards-card-title-{{ section_id }}">
          {{ section.settings.step3_title }}
        </h3>

        <p class="loyalty-rewards-card-description-{{ section_id }}">
          {{ section.settings.step3_description }}
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="loyalty-rewards-buttons-{{ section_id }}">
      {% if section.settings.primary_btn_link != blank %}
        <a href="{{ section.settings.primary_btn_link }}" class="loyalty-rewards-btn-primary-{{ section_id }}">
          {{ section.settings.primary_btn_text }}
        </a>
      {% endif %}

      {% if section.settings.secondary_btn_link != blank %}
        <a href="{{ section.settings.secondary_btn_link }}" class="loyalty-rewards-btn-secondary-{{ section_id }}">
          {{ section.settings.secondary_btn_text }}
        </a>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Loyalty rewards steps",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Eyebrow"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "eyebrow_text",
      "label": "Eyebrow text",
      "default": "LOYALTY PROGRAM"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "eyebrow_color",
      "label": "Eyebrow color",
      "default": "#D5A536"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Heading"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading_line1",
      "label": "Heading line 1",
      "default": "GET REWARDED FOR"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "heading_line1_color",
      "label": "Line 1 color",
      "default": "#ffffff"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading_line2",
      "label": "Heading line 2",
      "default": "LIVING OFF DUTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "gradient_color_1",
      "label": "Line 2 gradient start",
      "default": "#FF246D"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "gradient_color_2",
      "label": "Line 2 gradient middle",
      "default": "#FF543D"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "gradient_color_3",
      "label": "Line 2 gradient end",
      "default": "#FFA12D"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Description"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "description",
      "label": "Description text",
      "default": "Earn points when you shop, refer friends and support the Flip Flop Firefighter community."
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "description_color",
      "label": "Description color",
      "default": "#B8B5C0"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Background"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "bg_color_center",
      "label": "Center color",
      "default": "#1B1115"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "bg_color_mid",
      "label": "Mid color",
      "default": "#0D0B13"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "bg_color_outer",
      "label": "Outer color",
      "default": "#090810"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_accent_line",
      "label": "Show left accent line",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "accent_line_color",
      "label": "Accent line color",
      "default": "#FF5B38"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Cards"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "card_bg_color",
      "label": "Card background",
      "default": "#111016"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "card_border_color",
      "label": "Card border",
      "default": "rgba(255, 95, 45, 0.20)"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "card_text_color",
      "label": "Card description color",
      "default": "#B8B5C0"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Step 1"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "step1_number",
      "label": "Number",
      "default": "01"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "step1_icon",
      "label": "Icon",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "user",
          "label": "User"
        },
        {
          "value": "lightning",
          "label": "Lightning"
        },
        {
          "value": "gift",
          "label": "Gift"
        }
      ],
      "default": "user"
